    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Albert Lewis, dubbed the “Lumber and Ice King of Luzerne County,” founded Bear Creek’s lumber and ice operations, creating a company town with workers’ cottages and factories.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        7
      ],
