      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In the late 1990s the Bear Creek Village Historical Society applied for historic district status, and the district was added to the National Register of Historic Places in 1999.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
